sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Customer
    participant StoreAPI as Store API
    participant CartWF as addToCartWorkflow
    participant CartMod as Cart Module
    participant InvMod as Inventory Module
    participant InvLevelSvc as InventoryLevelService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Customer, DB: Add to Cart — Reservation Creation

    Customer->>StoreAPI: POST /store/carts/:id/line-items<br/>{ variant_id, quantity: 2 }

    StoreAPI->>CartWF: execute({ cart_id, variant_id, quantity: 2 })

    CartWF->>CartMod: createLineItemsStep<br/>({ cart_id, variant_id, quantity: 2 })
    CartMod->>DB: INSERT line_item
    DB-->>CartMod: line_item_id = "li_01"
    CartMod-->>CartWF: LineItemDTO

    CartWF->>InvMod: createReservationItems([{<br/>  inventory_item_id: "iitem_01",<br/>  location_id: "sloc_01",<br/>  quantity: 2,<br/>  line_item_id: "li_01"<br/>}])

    InvMod->>InvLevelSvc: confirmInventory("iitem_01", ["sloc_01"], 2)
    InvLevelSvc->>DB: SELECT SUM(stocked_quantity - reserved_quantity)<br/>WHERE inventory_item_id = 'iitem_01'<br/>AND location_id IN ('sloc_01')<br/>AND deleted_at IS NULL
    DB-->>InvLevelSvc: available = 10

    alt available >= quantity (10 >= 2)
        InvLevelSvc-->>InvMod: true
        InvMod->>DB: INSERT reservation_item<br/>(quantity=2, allow_backorder=false)
        DB-->>InvMod: ReservationItem
        InvMod-->>CartWF: ReservationItemDTO
    else available < quantity and !allow_backorder
        InvLevelSvc-->>InvMod: false
        InvMod-->>CartWF: throw NOT_ALLOWED
        CartWF-->>StoreAPI: 400 Insufficient stock
    end

    CartWF-->>StoreAPI: updated CartDTO
    StoreAPI-->>Customer: 200 { cart: { ... } }

    Note over Customer, DB: Order Fulfillment — Stock Deduction

    participant AdminAPI as Admin API
    participant FulfillWF as createFulfillmentWorkflow

    AdminAPI->>FulfillWF: POST /admin/orders/:id/fulfillments

    FulfillWF->>InvMod: deleteReservationItems(["resitem_01"])
    InvMod->>DB: UPDATE reservation_item SET deleted_at = now()
    DB-->>InvMod: ok

    FulfillWF->>InvMod: adjustInventory("iitem_01", "sloc_01", -2)
    InvMod->>InvLevelSvc: adjustInventory("iitem_01", "sloc_01", -2)
    InvLevelSvc->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (row lock)
    InvLevelSvc->>DB: UPDATE inventory_level<br/>SET stocked_quantity = stocked_quantity - 2
    DB-->>InvLevelSvc: updated level
    InvLevelSvc-->>InvMod: InventoryLevelDTO

    InvMod-->>FulfillWF: ok
    FulfillWF-->>AdminAPI: FulfillmentDTO
